    },
    {
      "text": "PROPOSED COMPLIANCE ORDER",
      "text_span": "",
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": 0,
      "font": "unknown",
      "all_cap": 0,
      "num_st": 0,
      "is_center": 0,
      "is_underline": 0,
      "label": "text",
      "page_no": 3,
      "structure": {
        "level": "Body",
        "level_index": 1,
        "parent_id": null,
        "path_text": "",
        "depth": 1,
        "h1_index_norm": 0,
        "sibling_index_norm": 0.8666666666666667,
        "is_first_child": false,
        "is_last_child": false
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pursuant to 49 United States Code § 60118, the Pipeline and Hazardous Materials Safety Administration (PHMSA) proposes to issue to Enbridge a Compliance Order incorporating the following remedial requirements to ensure the compliance of Enbridge with the pipeline safety regulations:",
      "text_span": "",
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": 0,
      "font": "unknown",
      "all_cap": 0,
      "num_st": 0,
      "is_center": 0,
      "is_underline": 0,
      "label": "text",
      "page_no": 3,
      "structure": {
        "level": "Body",
        "level_index": 1,
        "parent_id": null,
        "path_text": "",
        "depth": 1,
        "h1_index_norm": 0,
        "sibling_index_norm": 0.9,
        "is_first_child": false,
        "is_last_child": false
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In regard to Item 1 of the Notice pertaining to Enbridge's failure to use a launcher or receiver that is equipped with a relief device capable of safely relieving pressure in the barrel before insertion or removal of scrapers or spheres, Enbridge must train their field personnel in proper use of relief devices associated with launcher and receivers and 49 C.F.R. § 195.426 and then provide documentation of this training to Central Region Director, Gregory A. Ochs, within 180 days of receipt of the Final Order.",
      "text_span": "",
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": 0,
      "font": "unknown",
      "all_cap": 0,
      "num_st": 0,
      "is_center": 0,
      "is_underline": 0,
      "label": "list_item",
      "page_no": 3,
      "structure": {
        "level": "Body",
        "level_index": 1,
        "parent_id": null,
        "path_text": "",
        "depth": 1,
        "h1_index_norm": 0,
        "sibling_index_norm": 0.9333333333333333,
        "is_first_child": false,
        "is_last_child": false
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It is requested that Enbridge maintain documentation of the safety improvement costs associated with fulfilling this Compliance Order and submit the total to Gregory A. Ochs, Director, Central Region, Pipeline and Hazardous Materials Safety Administration. It is requested that these costs be reported in two categories: (1) total cost associated with preparation/revision of plans, procedures, studies and analyses, and (2) total cost associated with replacements, additions and other changes to pipeline infrastructure.",
      "text_span": "",
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": 0,
      "font": "unknown",
      "all_cap": 0,
      "num_st": 0,
      "is_center": 0,
      "is_underline": 0,
      "label": "text",
      "page_no": 3,
      "structure": {
